# Cloudflare Pages static headers file — applied at the edge, costs no
# Functions bundle size (see CLAUDE.md Recent Learnings 2026-08-02 re: the
# 25 MiB Functions bundle limit).
#
# Content-Security-Policy is DELIBERATELY OMITTED here. The editor relies on
# inline styles and blob: Web Workers (ffmpeg.wasm); a CSP tight enough to be
# meaningful would very likely break those without careful per-directive
# testing this pass didn't do. Revisit with a real audit of what the editor
# actually needs before adding one.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
